What is AI?
Artificial Intelligence is the broad field of building systems that can perform tasks that normally require human intelligence.

Different types of AI
1.Machine Learning (ML)
  Systems learn patterns from data rather than relying only on hard-coded rules.
2.Deep Learning
  Uses multi-layer neural networks to learn complex patterns. Example: Image recognition, speech recognition.
3.Generative AI
  Generates new content such as text, code, images, audio, and video.

